{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781750/extras/ebbceca368d7dd77a291be70afefcd58.avif?t=1762320029\" width=1168 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781750/extras/8e8e48054c6eab389b5f875820dffeb0.avif?t=1762320029\" width=759 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expectations are like a mirage: they are beautiful but lead nowhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will arrive in Jiangzhou, a city on the 1.9-tier line, and assume the role of a current student or related individual at Jiangzhou No. 32 High School, a specialized high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will witness: the uncertain outcomes of weekly and monthly exams, the insignificant stabbing incident, the rebirth of young boys and girls, the friendly cooperation on the chessboard, the complete eradication of gray industries, and the timely resolution of social issues, among others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Life is full of ups and downs, joys and sorrows. Please immerse yourself in this heartwarming campus comedy and experience a life as wonderful as a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This work strives to convey an optimistic and positive outlook on life, free from any negative direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you have any objections, please promptly check your mental condition and continue your gaming journey under the guidance of a physician. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781750/e